*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0015
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-03-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 437
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0015.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> CLAIM TYPE A=AUTO H=HOME M=MEDICAL
    05 LOSS-TYPE          PIC X.
    *> CLAIMED AMOUNT
    05 CLM-AMOUNT         PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> POLICY DEDUCTIBLE
    05 DEDUCT-AMT         PIC 9(5)V99.
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> AMOUNT PAID ON CLAIM
    05 SETTLE-AMT         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
    *> A=APPROVE I=INVESTIGATE D=DENY
    05 CLM-STAT-CD        PIC X VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CALC-PAYOUT
    DISPLAY "SETTLE-AMT=" SETTLE-AMT
    DISPLAY "CLM-STAT-CD=" CLM-STAT-CD
    STOP RUN.
CALC-PAYOUT.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> MEDICAL CO-INSURANCE
        WHEN LOSS-TYPE = 'M'
            COMPUTE SETTLE-AMT = CLM-AMOUNT * 0.70
        WHEN CLM-AMOUNT > 0.00
            COMPUTE SETTLE-AMT ROUNDED = CLM-AMOUNT - DEDUCT-AMT
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.00 TO SETTLE-AMT
            MOVE 'D' TO CLM-STAT-CD
    END-EVALUATE.
